## Prioritized Remediation Plan

| Priority | Test Method | Smell | Effort |
|----------|-------------|-------|--------|
| 1 | `addAndDoNothing` | Assertion-Free | ~1 min — add one assertion |
| 2 | `addNullSkuManualCatch` | Exception Handling | ~2 min — replace with `assertThrows` |
| 3 | `addSleepy` | Sleepy Test | ~1 min — delete `Thread.sleep` |
| 4 | `addLoadsFromFile` | Mystery Guest | ~2 min — inline data, delete file I/O |
| 5 | `addConditionalLogic` | Conditional Logic | ~3 min — flatten to explicit calls |
| 6 | `doEverythingAtOnce` | Eager Test | ~5 min — split into focused tests |
| 7 | `disabledTest` | Ignored Test | ~1 min — remove `@Disabled` |
| 8 | `setUp` (rng field) | General Fixture | ~1 min — delete unused field |
| 9 | `quantityAfterAdds` | Magic Number | ~2 min — use named constants |
| 10 | `toStringFormat` | Sensitive Equality | ~2 min — assert semantics not format |

Items 1–4 prevent **false-pass risk** (tests that look green but verify nothing meaningful) and should be fixed first. Items 5–10 improve maintainability and clarity.
